  dialogueLines:
  - Hi Simba! My Name is Mimo. Nice to meet you!!!
  - I have been living in this villiage since ages. You don't look like you are from here.
  - We all survive on dry food, but it doesn't grow on trees.
  - Just earlier today, I helped someone with their grocery shopping, and I earned a nice bowl of food for my trouble. Meow
